      <p>Minimalism in jewellery design celebrates the principle of "less is more"—the idea that carefully selected, high-quality pieces create more impact than an abundance of accessories. Minimal jewellery styling is about intentionality, quality, and letting each piece speak for itself. This approach creates a sophisticated, timeless aesthetic that transcends trends.</p>

